#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Predstavljanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please report any problems or feature requests to the <ulink url=\"http://"
"bugs.kde.org/\">&kde; Bug Tracking System</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Molimo prijavite bilo kakve probleme ili zahtjeve na <ulink url=\"http://"
"bugs.kde.org/\">&kde; Bug Tracking System</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &ksnapshot;"
msgstr "Upotreba &ksnapshot;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter describes the use of &ksnapshot; for capturing screen images."
msgstr "Ovo poglavlje opisuje korištenje &ksnapshot; za snimanje slika ekrana."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting &ksnapshot;"
msgstr "Pokretanje &ksnapshot;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ksnapshot; may be started by one of several ways as described below."
msgstr ""
"&ksnapshot; može se pokrenuti na jedan od načina kao što je opisano u "
"nastavku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may start &ksnapshot; by selecting it from the application launcher menu "
"<menuchoice> <guisubmenu>Applications</guisubmenu><guisubmenu>Graphics</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Screen Capture Program &ksnapshot;</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Možete pokrenuti &ksnapshot; selektujući ga na meniju za pokretanje "
"aplikacija <menuchoice> <guisubmenu>Aplikacije</"
"guisubmenu><guisubmenu>Grafika</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Program za slikanje "
"ekrana &ksnapshot;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may start &ksnapshot; by entering the following at the command prompt:"
msgstr "Možete pokrenuti &ksnapshot; upisivanjem sljedećeg na komandnu liniju:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "<prompt>%</prompt> <command>ksnapshot &amp;</command>"
msgstr "<prompt>%</prompt> <command>ksnapshot &amp;</command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The mini command line &krunner; (invoked with <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>) may also be used to start "
"&ksnapshot;."
msgstr ""
"Mala komandna linija &krunner; (pozvan sa <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;"
"<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>) isto se može koristiti za pokretanje "
"&ksnapshot;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "Once &ksnapshot; starts, you will see a window like the following:"
msgstr "Jednom kad &ksnapshot; pokrenete, vidjet ćete prozor kao na slici:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:149 index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ksnapshot; Preview Window"
msgstr "&ksnapshot; Prikaži prozor"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Taking A Snapshot"
msgstr "Slikanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ksnapshot; grabs an image of your entire desktop immediately after it is "
"started, but before it displays itself on screen. This allows you to quickly "
"create full-desktop screenshot images."
msgstr ""
"&ksnapshot; hvata sliku cijelog ekrana odmah nakon što je pokrenut, ali "
"prije nego što ga prikaže na ekranu. To vam omogućuje da brzo stvorite slike "
"cijelog ekrana."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The snapshot taken by &ksnapshot; is displayed in the preview window, which "
"is located on top of the &ksnapshot; application window. Below is an example "
"of the preview window from &ksnapshot;. Your preview will differ depending "
"on what you have displayed on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Slika uslikana pomoću &ksnapshot; se prikazuje u prozoru za prikaz, koji se "
"nalazi na vrhu &ksnapshot; prozora aplikacije. Ispod je primjer prozor sa "
"prikazom iz &ksnapshot;. Vaš pregled će se razlikovati ovisno o tome što ste "
"prikazati na ekranu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The snapshot can be saved by clicking on the <guibutton>Save As...</"
"guibutton> (<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo>) "
"button. This opens the standard &kde; save dialog, where you can choose the "
"filename, the folder location, and the format that your snapshot will be "
"saved in. If multiple snapshots are taken, the filename is automatically "
"incremented to prevent you from overwriting previous snapshots. You may "
"however edit the filename to anything you wish, including the name of a "
"previously saved snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Snimak mogu sačuvati klikom na <guibutton>Spasi kao...</guibutton> "
"(<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo>) tipku. To "
"otvara Standard &kde; spasiti dijalog, gdje možete odabrati ime datoteke, "
"lokaciju foldera, i formatu  kojem će vaš snimak biti sačuvan. Ako se uslika "
"više snimkaka, naziv datoteke se automatski povećava tako da onemogući "
"prepisivanja prethodne snimke. Ipak, možete uređivati datoteke za sve što "
"želite, uključujući ime prethodno sačuvanog snimka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To take a snapshot of a single window, select the <guilabel>Window Under "
"Cursor</guilabel> combo box entry (next to the <guilabel>Capture mode</"
"guilabel> label), and then click on the <guibutton>Take a New Snapshot</"
"guibutton> (<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>) "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Da uslikate jedan prozor, selektujte <guilabel>Prozor Ispod Kursora</"
"guilabel> kutija kombinovanih unosa (pored  <guilabel>Režim snimanja</"
"guilabel> oznaka), zatim kliknite na <guibutton>Uslikajte novu sliku</"
"guibutton> (<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>) "
"dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on your <guilabel>Snapshot delay</guilabel> settings you get "
"either a cross as the mouse pointer (for <guilabel>No delay</guilabel>), or "
"a standard mouse cursor which you can use to work with a program until the "
"delay is over and a snapshot is taken."
msgstr ""
"U zavisnosti od vašeg <guilabel>Kašnjenje snimka</guilabel>postavki koje ste "
"dobili ili krst kod pokazivača miša (za <guilabel>Bez kašnjenja</guilabel>), "
"ili standardni miš koji možete koristiti za rad sa programom dok kašnjenje "
"nije gotova, a snimka snimljena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With <guilabel>No delay</guilabel>, the snapshot is taken immediately when "
"you click into a window."
msgstr ""
"Sa <guilabel>Bez odgađanja</guilabel>, snimak je uslikan odmah kada kliknete "
"na prozor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ksnapshot; will display the new snapshot in the preview area, at which time "
"you can choose to save the new image (by pressing <guibutton>Save As...</"
"guibutton>) or to grab a new one, by pressing the <guibutton>Take a New "
"Snapshot</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"&ksnapshot; će prikazati novi snimak u području prikaza, na kojem u trenutku "
"možete odabrati da spasite novu sliku (pritiskom<guibutton>Spasi kao...</"
"guibutton>) ili odabirom nove, klikom na <guibutton>Uslikajte novu sliku</"
"guibutton> dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To take a new snapshot of the entire desktop, select the <guilabel>Full "
"Screen</guilabel> combo box entry and then click on the <guibutton>Take a "
"New Snapshot</guibutton> button. &ksnapshot; will now capture the entire "
"desktop if you press <guibutton>Take a New Snapshot</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Da uslikate novu sliku cijelog ekrana, selektujte <guilabel>Cijeli Ekran</"
"guilabel> kutiju kombinovanih unosa, a zatim kliknite na "
"<guibutton>Uslikajte Novu Sliku</guibutton> dugme. &ksnapshot; će uslikati "
"cijeli ekran ako kliknete <guibutton>Uslikaj novu sliku</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Similarly, to take a snapshot of a rectangular region, select the "
"<guilabel>Rectangular Region</guilabel> combo box entry and set the "
"<guilabel>Snapshot delay</guilabel> to <guilabel>No delay</guilabel>, and "
"then click on the <guibutton>Take a New Snapshot</guibutton> button. The "
"mouse cursor will then change into a cross, and you can then use the mouse "
"to select the region you want to capture. To take the snapshot press the "
"&Enter; key or double click. Press &Esc; to quit."
msgstr ""
"Slično tome, da se uslika pravougaona regija, odaberite "
"<guilabel>Pravougaona Regija</guilabel> kutiju kombinovanih unosa i "
"postavite <guilabel>Odgađanje slikanja</guilabel>na <guilabel>Nema "
"Odgađanja</guilabel>,zatim kliknite na <guibutton>Uslikajte novu sliku</"
"guibutton> dugme. Kursor miša će se potom promijeniti u dodavanje, i tada "
"možete koristiti miš za odabir regije koju želite snimiti. Za snimanje "
"fotografija pritisnite &Enter; tipku ili dvostruki klik. Pritisnite &Esc; da "
"poništite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might want to take a snapshot of a non rectangular region. You can do so "
"by selecting the <guilabel>Freehand Region</guilabel> combo box entry and "
"set the <guilabel>Snapshot delay</guilabel> to <guilabel>No delay</"
"guilabel>, and then click on the <guibutton>Take a New Snapshot</guibutton> "
"button. The mouse cursor will then change into a cross, and you can then use "
"the mouse to draw the region you want to capture. To take the snapshot press "
"the &Enter; key or double click. Press &Esc; to quit."
msgstr ""
"Možda želite da uslikate nepravougaonu regiji. Možete to učiniti odabirom "
"<guilabel>Slobodna Regija</guilabel>kutija kombinovanih unosa i postavite na "
"<guilabel>Odgađanje slikanja</guilabel> na <guilabel>Nema Odgađanja</"
"guilabel>,zatim kliknite na <guibutton>Uslikajte novu sliku</guibutton> "
"dugme. Kursor miša će se potom promijeniti u dodavanje, i tada možete "
"koristiti miš za odabir regije koju želite snimiti. Za snimanje fotografija "
"pritisnite &Enter; tipku ili dvostruki klik. Pritisnite &Esc; da poništite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To take a new snapshot of a section of a window, select the "
"<guilabel>Section of Window</guilabel> combo box entry and then click on the "
"<guibutton>Take a New Snapshot</guibutton> button. With <guilabel>No delay</"
"guilabel> you get a cross as the mouse pointer and you have to click once "
"with the &LMB; into the window. The section of the window under the mouse "
"cursor is now highlighted with a red border. Move the mouse to the wanted "
"section and click the &LMB; to capture the screenshot."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uslikali novu sliku jednog dijela prozora, odaberite <guilabel>Dio "
"Prozora</guilabel> kutija kombinovanih unosa <guibutton>Uslikajte novu "
"sliku</guibutton> dugme.  Pomoću <guilabel>Nema Odgađanja</guilabel> "
"dobijete krst kao pokazivač miša i morate klikniti jednom sa &LMB; na "
"prozor. Dio prozora ispod kursora je sada istaknut sa crvenom granicom. "
"Pomaknite miš ka željenom odjeljku i kliknite na &LMB; da uslikate novu "
"sliku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have multiple screens, <guilabel>Current Screen</guilabel> captures "
"the screen containing the mouse cursor when the screenshot is taken."
msgstr ""
"Ako imate više ekrana, <guilabel>Trenutni ekran</guilabel> snima ekran koji "
"sadrži kursor miša, kada se slika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When keeping &ksnapshot; open to take several snapshots using <guibutton> "
"Rectangular Region</guibutton> or <guibutton>Freehand Region</guibutton>, "
"the subsequent snapshots will be initialized with the last shape used with "
"this function (since you launched &ksnapshot;). You have then the "
"possibility to adjust the handles of the rectangular shape, to move the "
"freehand region, or to completely replace the shape by starting to draw a "
"new one at a different place of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Kada držite &ksnapshot; otvoren da uslika nekoliko slika ekrana koristeći "
"<guibutton>Pravougaona Regija</guibutton> ili <guibutton>Slobodna Regija</"
"guibutton>, naknadne snimke biće inicijalizovane posljednjim oblikom "
"korištenim pomoću ove funkcije (otkad si pokrenuo &ksnapshot;). Imate zatim "
"mogućnost za podešavanje rukohvata pravougaonog oblika, za pomicanje "
"slobodnom regijom, ili u potpunosti zamijeniti oblik crtajući novi oblik na "
"drugom mjeestu ekrana."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional Features"
msgstr "Dodatne Funkcije"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "Snapshot Delay"
msgstr "Kašnjenje slike ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Snapshot delay</guilabel> box allows you to enter an arbitrary "
"time delay, in seconds, between the time that you press the <guibutton>Take "
"a New Snapshot</guibutton> button and the time that the snapshot is taken."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Odgađanje slike ekrana</guilabel> kutija vam omogućava da unesete "
"proizvoljno vrijeme kašnjenja, u sekundama, između vremena kada pritisnete "
"<guibutton>Uslikaj novu sliku ekrana</guibutton> dugmeta i vremena kada je "
"slika ekrana uslikana."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a delay time has been set, you do not have to click the mouse button to "
"capture a screenshot. This enables you to open a drop down menu, and take a "
"picture of it."
msgstr ""
"Kada je postavljeno vremena kašnjenja, ne morate kliknuti tipku miša za "
"slikanje slike ekrana. To vam omogućuje da otvorite padajući meni, i slikate "
"ga."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exclude Window decorations"
msgstr "Isključi dekoracije prozora"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Include window decorations</guilabel> is enabled by default in "
"<guilabel>Window Under Cursor</guilabel> mode."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uključi prozor dekoracije</guilabel>je podrazumijevano "
"uključen<guilabel>Prozor ispod kursora</guilabel> način."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you only want to capture the application itself without the surrounding "
"window decoration, disable this option and take a new snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Kada samo želite snimiti samu aplikaciju, bez okolnih dekoracija prozora, "
"onemogućiti ovu opciju i uslikajte novu sliku ekrana."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid "Include mouse pointer"
msgstr "Uključi pokazivač miša"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Include mouse pointer</guilabel> is disabled by default. This "
"setting is not available in <guilabel>Rectangular Region</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Freehand Region</guilabel> modes."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uključi pokazivač miša</guilabel> je podrazumijevano prikazan. Ova "
"postavka nije dostupna u <guilabel>Pravougaonoj Regiji</guilabel> i "
"<guilabel>Slobodnoj Regiji</guilabel> načinu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you want to include the mouse pointer in your snapshot, enable this "
"option and take a new snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Kada želite uključiti pokazivač miša u vašoj slici ekrana, omogućite ovu "
"opciju i uslikajte novu sliku ekrana."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "Dugmad"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are four buttons located at the bottom of the &ksnapshot; window. "
"Their function is described below."
msgstr ""
"Postoje četiri tipke koje se nalaze na dnu &ksnapshot; prozora. Njihova "
"funkcionalnost je opisana ispod."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Pomoć"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Gives you a menu where you can open the <guimenuitem>&ksnapshot; Handbook</"
"guimenuitem>, report a bug, switch the language for &ksnapshot; or get some "
"more information <guimenuitem>About &ksnapshot;</guimenuitem> and "
"<guimenuitem>About &kde;</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Daje vam izbornik gdje možete otvoriti <guimenuitem>&ksnapshot; Priručnik</"
"guimenuitem>, prijavi grešku, zamijeni jezik za &ksnapshot; ili dobij više "
"informacija <guimenuitem>O &ksnapshot;</guimenuitem> i <guimenuitem>About "
"&kde;</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "Send To..."
msgstr "Pošalji na..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will allow to directly open the snapshot with all programs that are "
"associated with your PNG (Portable Network Graphics) MIME type. Depending on "
"what programs are installed, you will be able to open and edit the snapshot "
"in your graphics applications or viewers."
msgstr ""
"To će vam omogućiti da direktno otvorite sliku ekrana sa svim programima "
"koji su povezani sa vašim PNG (Prenosna Mržna Grafika) MIME tipa. Ovisno o "
"tome koji su instalirani programi, moći ćete otvoriti i uređivati slike u "
"vašoj grafičkoj aplikaciji ili prikazivaču."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Furthermore, if you have the <application>KIPI plugins</application> "
"installed you will be able to print your snapshots, e-mail them and export "
"directly to some social networks and websites, as shown on the screenshot "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Osim toga, ako imate <application>KIPI dodatke</application> instalirane "
"bićete u mogućnosti da odštampate snimke, proslijediti ih e-mailom izravno "
"na neke društvene mreže i web stranice, kao što je prikazano na slici ispod."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ksnapshot; Send To... menu with kipi-plugins installed"
msgstr "&ksnapshot; Pošalji na... meni sa kipi-dodatcima instaliranim"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopiranje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you want to edit your snapshot in a graphics application without saving "
"the snapshot, just click <guibutton>Copy</guibutton> (<keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo>) and insert the image into a "
"viewer or graphics application."
msgstr ""
"Kada želite urediti vašu sliku ekrana u grafičkoj aplikaciji bez spremanja "
"slike, samo kliknite<guibutton>Kopiraj</guibutton> (<keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo>) i ubacite sliku u aplikaciju za "
"prikazivanje ili grafičku aplikaciju."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save As..."
msgstr "Spasi kao..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves the screenshot to a file in the selected format."
msgstr "Spasi sliku ekrana u fajl odabranog formata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "Drag and Drop"
msgstr "Privuci i spusti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A captured image can be dragged to another application or document. If the "
"application is able to handle images, a copy of the full image is inserted "
"there."
msgstr ""
"A uslikana slika može biti povučena u drugi program ili dokument. Ako je "
"aplikacija u mogućnosti za rukovanje slike, kopija cijele slike je tamo "
"postavljena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you drag a screenshot into a file manager window, a dialog pops up where "
"you can edit the filename and select the image format and the file will be "
"inserted into the actual folder."
msgstr ""
"Ako povučete sliku ekrana u  prozor menadžera datoteka, iskače dijalog u "
"kojem možete uređivati datoteke i odabrati format slike i datoteka će biti "
"umetnuta u stvarni folder."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you drag the screenshot to a text box, the path to the temporary saved "
"file is inserted. This is useful for example to upload a screenshot through "
"web forms or to attach screenshots into bug reports on the <ulink url="
"\"https://bugs.kde.org/\">&kde; bugtracker</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko povučete sliku ekrana u okvir za tekst, put do privremeno sačuvane "
"datoteke je umetnut. Ovo je korisno za primjer učitavanja slike ekrana putem "
"web forme ili da priložite slike ekrana u izvještaju grešaka na  <ulink url ="
"\"https://bugs.kde.org/\">&kde; bugtracker </ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This works with all clients that do not pick up the image data, but only "
"look for a &URL; in the dragged mimedata."
msgstr ""
"Ovo radi sa svim klijentima koji ne kupe podatke slike, već samo traže &URL; "
"u povučenom mimedata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid "&DBus; Interface"
msgstr "&DBus; Interfejs"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ksnapshot; can be scripted using its &DBus; interface."
msgstr "&ksnapshot; može biti dokumentovan koristeći &DBus; interfejs."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two ways to use the &DBus; interface: &Qt;'s &GUI; "
"<application>qdbusviewer</application> and the command line "
"<application>qdbus</application>."
msgstr ""
"Postoje dva načina za korištenje &DBus; interfejsa: &Qt;'s &GUI; "
"<application>qdbusviewer</application> i komandna linija <application>qdbus</"
"application>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "Primjeri:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>&percnt;</prompt> <command>qdbus</command> will display all services "
"available."
msgstr ""
"<prompt>&percnt;</prompt> <command>qdbus</command> ćeprikazati sve dostupne "
"usluge."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>&percnt;</prompt> <command>qdbus</command> <option>org.kde.ksnapshot-"
"`pidof -s ksnapshot`</option> will display the &DBus; interface for "
"&ksnapshot;."
msgstr ""
"<prompt>&percnt;</prompt> <command>qdbus</command> <option>org.kde.ksnapshot-"
"`pidof -s ksnapshot`</option>će prikazati &DBus; interfejs za &ksnapshot;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>&percnt;</prompt> <command>qdbus</command> <option>org.kde.ksnapshot-"
"`pidof -s ksnapshot` /KSnapshot</option> will display methods for "
"controlling &ksnapshot;."
msgstr ""
"<prompt>&percnt;</prompt> <command>qdbus</command> <option>org.kde.ksnapshot-"
"`pidof -s ksnapshot` /KSnapshot</option>ćeprikazati metode za kontrolisanje "
"&ksnapshot;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information, please visit <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/"
"Development/Tutorials/D-Bus/Introduction\">&DBus; tutorial</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija, molimo posjetite <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/"
"Development/Tutorials/D-Bus/Introduction\">&DBus; tutorial</ulink>."

